                │
       ┌────────┼─────────┐
       ▼        ▼         ▼
   Summary   Concepts   Vocabulary
       │        │         │
       └────────┼─────────┘
                ▼
       🌍 Multilingual Explanation
                │
                ▼
        ❓ Question Extraction
                │
                ▼
          🎯 Interactive Quiz
                │
                ▼
          💬 Ask A2Z Chatbot
